### =========================================================================
### 1. REQUESTFORM ENTITY - BASIC AUTHORIZATION CHECKS
### =========================================================================

### REQUESTOR can READ (Expected: 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm
Authorization: {{requestor}}

### REVIEWER can READ (Expected: 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm
Authorization: {{reviewer}}

### MANAGER can READ (Expected: 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm
Authorization: {{admin}}

### UNAUTHORIZED cannot READ (Expected: 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm
Authorization: {{unauthorized}}

### REQUESTOR can CREATE Draft (Expected: 201)
# @name BasicCreate
POST {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm
Authorization: {{requestor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ 
    "formType_code": "NewStock", 
    "plant_plant_Plant": "3030" 
}

### Save ID for next steps
@basicFormId = {{BasicCreate.response.body.ID}}

### REVIEWER cannot CREATE (Expected: 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm
Authorization: {{reviewer1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "formType_code": "NewStock", "plant_plant_Plant": "3030" }

### MANAGER cannot CREATE (Expected: 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm
Authorization: {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "formType_code": "NewStock", "plant_plant_Plant": "3030" }

### REQUESTOR can UPDATE Draft (Expected: 200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm(ID={{basicFormId}},IsActiveEntity=false)
Authorization: {{requestor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "safetyStockReq": "28" }

### MANAGER cannot UPDATE Draft (Expected: 403)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm(ID={{basicFormId}},IsActiveEntity=false)
Authorization: {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "safetyStockReq": "28" }

### REQUESTOR cannot DELETE Active Entity (Expected: 403)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm(ID={{basicFormId}},IsActiveEntity=true)
Authorization: {{requestor}}


### =========================================================================
### 2. BASE APPROVAL PROCESS 
### =========================================================================

### Setup: Crear Draft
# @name BaseFlowCreate
POST {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm
Authorization: {{requestor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "formType_code": "NewStock", "plant_plant_Plant": "3080" }

### Save ID for next steps
@baseFormId = {{BaseFlowCreate.response.body.ID}}

### PATCH fields required for NewStock
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm(ID={{baseFormId}},IsActiveEntity=false)
Authorization: {{requestor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "equipmentNumber": "EQ-001",
    "chemicalApproval_code": "Yes",
    "vendor_Supplier": "VEND-001",
    "vendorPartNumber": "VPN-001",
    "manufacturer": "MANUF-001",
    "manufacturerPartNumber": "MPN-001",
    "materialClass_ClassInternalID": "CLASS-001",
    "materialClassCharact": "[{\"name\":\"DUMMY_CHAR\",\"selectedValue\":\"DUMMY_VAL\"}]",
    "estCostPerUnit": 100,
    "estDeliveryTime": 10,
    "functionalLocation": "FL-001",
    "justification": "Stock Justification",
    "estUsagePerYear": 100,
    "maxQtyPerUse": 10,
    "safetyStockReq": "10",
    "specialStorageReq": "N/A",
    "isPreventativeMaintReq": "No",
    "willReqSupplyStock": true
}

### Bypass the attachment validation by creating a mock attachment draft
POST {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm(ID={{baseFormId}},IsActiveEntity=false)/attachments
Authorization: {{requestor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "note": "dummy"
}

### Setup: Fill required fields and activate
POST {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm(ID={{baseFormId}},IsActiveEntity=false)/CatalogService.draftActivate
Authorization: {{requestor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Step 1: REVIEWER 1 can APPROVE (Expected: 204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm(ID={{baseFormId}},IsActiveEntity=true)/CatalogService.approveRequest
Authorization: {{reviewer1}}

### Step 2: REVIEWER 2 can APPROVE (Expected: 204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm(ID={{baseFormId}},IsActiveEntity=true)/CatalogService.approveRequest
Authorization: {{reviewer2}}

### Step 3: REVIEWER 3 can APPROVE (Expected: 204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm(ID={{baseFormId}},IsActiveEntity=true)/CatalogService.approveRequest
Authorization: {{reviewer3}}

### Step 4: REVIEWER 4 can APPROVE (Expected: 204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm(ID={{baseFormId}},IsActiveEntity=true)/CatalogService.approveRequest
Authorization: {{reviewer4}}


### =========================================================================
### 3. APPROVAL PROCESS WITH 1 APPROVER (Plant 3333, NonStock)
### =========================================================================

### Setup
# @name Flow1AppCreate
POST {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm
Authorization: {{requestor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "formType_code": "NonStock", "plant_plant_Plant": "3333" }

### Save ID for next steps
@form1AppId = {{Flow1AppCreate.response.body.ID}}

### PATCH fields required for NonStock
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm(ID={{form1AppId}},IsActiveEntity=false)
Authorization: {{requestor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "equipmentNumber": "EQ-001",
    "chemicalApproval_code": "Yes",
    "vendor_Supplier": "VEND-001",
    "vendorPartNumber": "VPN-001",
    "manufacturer": "MANUF-001",
    "manufacturerPartNumber": "MPN-001",
    "materialClass_ClassInternalID": "CLASS-001",
    "materialClassCharact": "[{\"name\":\"DUMMY_CHAR\",\"selectedValue\":\"DUMMY_VAL\"}]",
    "estCostPerUnit": 100,
    "estDeliveryTime": 10
}

### Bypass the attachment validation by creating a mock attachment draft
POST {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm(ID={{form1AppId}},IsActiveEntity=false)/attachments
Authorization: {{requestor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "note": "dummy"
}

### Activate
POST {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm(ID={{form1AppId}},IsActiveEntity=false)/CatalogService.draftActivate
Authorization: {{requestor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Step 1: REVIEWER 1 (3333) can APPROVE (Expected: 204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm(ID={{form1AppId}},IsActiveEntity=true)/CatalogService.approveRequest
Authorization: {{rev1_3333}}

### Verify if it'a approved or if it has SAP error
GET {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm(ID={{form1AppId}},IsActiveEntity=true)
Authorization: {{requestor}}

### Step 1: if SAP_ERROR REVIEWER 1 (3333) can re-approve, if status Approved then cannot approve again
POST {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm(ID={{form1AppId}},IsActiveEntity=true)/CatalogService.approveRequest
Authorization: {{rev1_3333}}


