### =========================================================================
### 10. RESUBMISSION OF REJECTED FORM BY REQUESTOR
### =========================================================================

### REQUESTOR can Edit and Save (Resubmit) the rejected form (Using the form from section 7)
# @name ResubmitDraftEdit
POST {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm(ID={{rejectFormId}},IsActiveEntity=true)/CatalogService.draftEdit
Authorization: {{requestor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "PreserveChanges": true }

### REQUESTOR PATCH (Expected: 200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm(ID={{rejectFormId}},IsActiveEntity=false)
Authorization: {{requestor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "safetyStockReq": "99" }

### REQUESTOR Activate again (Expected: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm(ID={{rejectFormId}},IsActiveEntity=false)/CatalogService.draftActivate
Authorization: {{requestor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### REVIEWER 1 can APPROVE again after resubmission
POST {{baseUrl}}/RequestForm(ID={{rejectFormId}},IsActiveEntity=true)/CatalogService.approveRequest
Authorization: {{reviewer1}}


